[Event "Italian Game"]
[Site "Chess Lab"]
[Family "e4 e5"]
[PlayAs "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 {The friendliest way to play 1.e4. Bishop eyes f7, c3 and d3 build a slow, solid centre you can push with d4 later.} e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Bc5 4. c3 Nf6 5. d3 d6 6. O-O O-O *

[Event "Ruy Lopez, Morphy Defence"]
[Site "Chess Lab"]
[Family "e4 e5"]
[PlayAs "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 {The most respected 1.e4 opening. Bb5 pressures the knight that defends e5; the a6/b5 chase gains time but loosens the queenside.} e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. Re1 b5 7. Bb3 d6 8. c3 O-O *

